# Birds

A small wiki for a birdwatching notebook. Start with [[barn-owl]],
[[common-raven]], and [[european-robin]], then follow [[field-notes]] to see how
several observations of one species differ from several species.

[[collection-views]] shows the same notebook as lists, sets, and maps.
The observation counts and route are illustrative.

The species catalog is computed from the cards:

```hql#eval
bird_cards = cards
| filter(c => c.metadata.category == "bird")

bird_cards
| sort(by = c => c.name)
| map(c => c.title)
```
